Norwegian Construction AI Agent - deployment configuration

This repository includes OpenConstructionERP as a Git submodule. Dockerfile
uses its official application image; Dockerfile.free applies an optional reduced
resource profile from deploy/free-tier/ to the same pinned image.
OpenConstructionERP is maintained by DataDrivenConstruction and its contributors.
